    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99340c92e7364a3879638c8d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员你可不能背着我，\n去偷偷享受其他马娘比赛的乐趣哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "de69aa91e765ec8885d928bcfe282721be8303af02bb4106430d42c29922cdd6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1077/storytimeline_501077112.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        38,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/38/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:50c92435727da7603fe86b55",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "正是因为能深刻理解对方，\n才能百分百的发挥各自的优势。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e24ec23ceb86f19cb262e1ed46044d0089efeaf87394de5f644bed89eb7cdf36",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1077/storytimeline_501077112.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        39,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/39/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4af321f4f6332769591ebae2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "方便找其他人陪你一起去吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "da3c4f8cd01735897e0c93a8d1c13df568049957b110238b1adfe54f929569e8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1077/storytimeline_501077112.json",
