      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bee53972d2963acf7fc71236",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "原计划使用抽奖抽中的温泉旅行票在当天去旅行，\n偏偏我那天受伤轻微骨折了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "87d96180cba2c6080ea047cbb0b703548dad61a89c306d9294e2e9b154bae81d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1077/storytimeline_501077112.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e38702889eb10fe9d052695a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在那么一瞬间，\n我感受到了和成田路之间无可替代的羁绊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae9fac70c2b125dbb393ed827d57046f0b7095f45c5adb65bc44c7d29c82f9e5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1077/storytimeline_501077112.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        40,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/40/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c24bcdf854a34565375d7b9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "成田路是个无论跟谁都能搞好关系的孩子，\n能代替我跟她一起去的对象应该大有人在……",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c7fe50a388a955206fc08e6884fef18eac6600a8b07de5cfbc72010d43dbf99",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1077/storytimeline_501077112.json",
