      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我想象中的旅行，\n如果不是跟训练员一起的话就没有意义了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "385aadfcb5795082aada2a3124a4188f85ec2f4fa38d942b5d5c1e80347ed231",
